# Testing

`src/lib/greeting/__tests__/index.test.ts` tests the greeting module.
Direct module tests match their source names in adjacent `__tests__/` folders.
Public contract suites and type assertions belong in `src/__tests__/`.
The workspace check command checks type assertions. Vitest does not run them.

The package's test script runs unit tests. Build verification checks the installed package and declarations.
Compatibility checks run built exports. CI uses the package's Node.js floor.
See the [package structure rules](../../../docs/agents/package-structure.md).
